  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIWI/ICBA Tigris River Basin, 2013-2018</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SIWI/ICBA Tigris River Basin, 2013-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Improved dialogue and trust in the Euphrates and Tigris region on transboundary water management 2. Use new knowledge of commonly agreed and ground-truth evidence based information on Euphrates and Tigris regional water use and services</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen bidrar till &#xf6;vergripande strategim&#xe5;l om H&#xe5;llbar utveckling   som f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrar f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r fred, stabilitet och frihet i      regionen. Den riktar sig vidare till sektorm&#xe5;let om Mer h&#xe5;llbar       anv&#xe4;ndning av regionens vattenresurs, med tydligt fokus p&#xe5;            klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention contributes towards the overall strategy objective   of &quot;Sustainable development that                                       improves conditions for peace, stability and freedom in the region&quot;. lt further addresses the sector                                        objective &quot;More sustainable use of the region&apos;s water resources,     clearly taking the effects of climate change</narrative>
  </description>
